	"notice": "MkII generation, distinct from MiniLab 3. USB MIDI only; no DIN output. Load/configure a preset with MIDI Control Center. Eight physical pads can address two banks; mappings are not fixed. Physical controls and keys remain unbound because presets, modes and octave settings determine messages. Diagrams are selected-control schematics, not dimensioned panel drawings. Port names are recorded only when documented; otherwise detection uses an unambiguous complete model name or manual selection.",
